// app/build.gradle.kts — single application module.
//
// Stack non-goals (per project plan §Stack non-goals):
//   - No Hilt / Dagger. DI is manual through `core/di/AppGraph.kt`.
//   - No Room. The example feature returns hardcoded data.
//   - No KSP plugin. Avoids annotation-processor churn across AGP/Kotlin
//     version drift.
//   - No multi-module split. Single `:app` only.
//
// Compose compiler is auto-managed by the Kotlin 2.0 plugin (no explicit
// kotlinCompilerExtensionVersion needed). Retrofit + Moshi stay because they
// don't need an annotation processor when used with the reflective converter.

